	"__readme__": "Manual hide-list for the Export Data dialog. Key = DocType name; a child table can also be keyed by its own DocType name (e.g. 'Employee Internal Work History') to filter inside that block. Value = array of FIELDNAMES (never labels). Naming a Table field such as 'custom_fingerprints' removes the ENTIRE child block it opens (all Fingerprint Data columns), not a single column. Applies to EVERY user, Administrator included - this is curation, not permission. 'name' (the ID column) cannot be hidden. A hidden field also disappears from the Data Import template. Docs: customize_erpnext/overrides/export_dialog/README.md",
